<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_32> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 31 of the principal Act is amended in subsection (2) by inserting after the words \"30(3)(d) of this Act\" the words \"which does not exceed thirty-five thousand ringgit\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/33/eng@> .
