<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/33/eng@/~chp_II__cl_11__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subparagraph (l)(b)(ii) the following subparagraph: \"(ii) any expenses incurred for the repair or maintenance of the premises (excluding expenses of a capital nature and expenses incurred in connection with the upkeep of land attached to the premises for use by way of amenity as garden or grounds) which the employee, pursuant to the terms on which that accommodation is so provided, is legally bound to meet in respect of that accommodation during that period;\""@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/33/eng@> .
