<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/33/eng@/~chp_V__cl_40> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 25 the following section: \"Exemptions by Minister 26. (1) The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, exempt any offshore company from all or any of the provisions of this Act either generally or in respect of any chargeable profits of that company. (2) Any order made under subsection (1) shall be laid before the Dewan Rakyat.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/33/eng@> .
